            <div xml:id="d485">

                <pb facs="0557" n="469" xml:id="pg469"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/1068: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-09T15:00:00-02:00">February 9, 1933—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received February 9—1:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>18. Department’s telegram 24, February 8, 5 p.m. Brazilian Government will
                    formulate its proposals to Peru in a telegram to the Brazilian Legation, Lima, a
                    copy of which I will telegraph you when received by Embassy. Proposals will be
                    in accordance with your suggestions as contained in telegram 24, February 8, 5
                    p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
